# A partial over a VALUE handed more arguments than any arm of its callee
# takes. Nothing can finish it, and the sentence names the arities that
# exist — the interpreter's, now said by native and the page too (RULED
# 2026-08-29, "the backends build the partial over a value").
fn plus a b
  a + b

fn over f
  &f 1

pub play = print "{(over plus) 2 3}"
